<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC's monthly maize estimates (July/June, million tonnes). *Revisions for 95/96. 96/97(Feb) 96/97 (Jan) 95/96</p>
<p> Opening stocks	 1.647     1.653	     1.671</p>
<p> Harvested crop	14.212    13.997	    12.394</p>
<p> Use on farms	   1.912     2.017	    *1.974</p>
<p> Other domestic use   3.685     3.378	    *2.971</p>
<p>  - incl. animal feed 2.600     2.300	    *1.916</p>
<p> Exports to EU	  6.000     5.920	     6.087</p>
<p> Non-EU exports	 0.100     0.200	     0.164</p>
<p> Final stocks	   2.825     2.827	    *1.647</p>
</text>
